<title>USA: Mikros names Thomas Meaney chairman.</title>
<headline>Mikros names Thomas Meaney chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikros Systems Corp said Thomas Meaney has been appointed to the position of chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Meaney has been associated with Mikros since 1986 and was most recently president and chief executive, Mikros said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Meaney replaces Wayne Meyer, who will continue as a director.</p>
